        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive alone against a never ending horde of undead! How long can you survive? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quarantine City</strong> is a simple 2D bullet-hell game where you can explore the city, find guns, and kill as many zombies as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a recent outbreak at a nearby military facility, all citizens are ordered to evacuate the city before 10Am.. However; you overslept.. Now you must battle an endless horde of infection and survive as long as you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I created this game in a few months with my own game engine written with C++. While the pixel art is an accumulation of years of hand-drawn work, some of the pixel art orignially came from OpenGameArt, however; was edited extensively to fit my design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can walk around using WSAD keys and aim/fire their weapons using their mouse! Simply bump into doors and crates to open them and using G will allow you to pick up new weapons. Pressing P will allow you to pause the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies will drop ammo and antidote's to help keep your ammo replinished and infection level low.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can adjust their audio settings once the game has started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Would you like to see additional features? Please let me know!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This game was created by a solo-developer using no game engine!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive alone against a never ending horde of undead! How long can you survive? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quarantine City</strong> is a simple 2D bullet-hell game where you can explore the city, find guns, and kill as many zombies as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a recent outbreak at a nearby military facility, all citizens are ordered to evacuate the city before 10Am.. However; you overslept.. Now you must battle an endless horde of infection and survive as long as you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I created this game in a few months with my own game engine written with C++. While the pixel art is an accumulation of years of hand-drawn work, some of the pixel art orignially came from OpenGameArt, however; was edited extensively to fit my design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can walk around using WSAD keys and aim/fire their weapons using their mouse! Simply bump into doors and crates to open them and using G will allow you to pick up new weapons. Pressing P will allow you to pause the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies will drop ammo and antidote's to help keep your ammo replinished and infection level low.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can adjust their audio settings once the game has started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Would you like to see additional features? Please let me know!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This game was created by a solo-developer using no game engine!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
